Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for five seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.35,0:00:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like for you to draw Mr. Braun's attention
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so he doesn't notice any shaking from the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to seduce him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're seducing him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind. I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"No way"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:41.00,op trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Even the billions of heartbeats in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:35.63,op kara,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,0)}suujuuoku mo no kodou no kazu sae
