Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the 42-inch CRT on the first floor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,just happens to function as the lifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So we were only able to send
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Mails when the studio was open and the TV was on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes a lot of sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so loud. It hurts my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Braun...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd resort to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In a way, it's your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who wanted to run an experiment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we almost completely understand
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,how the PhoneWave works now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.07,0:03:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that next...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,we should consider physically transporting an object through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't dismiss it so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to end up jelly, no matter what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And how, exactly, do you fit a human into 36 bytes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the time for showing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to show off to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the title of my paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Analysis of Nerve Pulse Signals
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stored in Memory Within the Temporal Lobe."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get that in a language I understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Essentially, it has to do with people's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I majored in neuroscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Put simply,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the brain stores memories as pulse signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a type of electrical data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Data... You can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending a human through time is impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but it might be possible to send their memory data.
