Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more of a time leap than time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All the lines have converged at one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan will now enter its final stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The goddess who rules the present...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin Operation Verthandi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain what you're talking about a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying we're going to do that time leap you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll need a lot of stuff to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we only have to read memories stored in the temporal lobe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so I think I can get everything in Akiba...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,One problem is that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think the PhoneWave will be able
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to sufficiently compress the memory data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make a list of the parts I need for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too hard for Mayushii to understand it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina just explained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sending your mind, as it exists right now, to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the D-Mail not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many chaotic variables with the D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One message can change things you'd never expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's okay to send memories into the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, you can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,prevent the past from changing to some degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have the entire city of Akiba changing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The city?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens to you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,after you send your memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body's still here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Mayushii is talking to Okarin now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you're saying Mayushii goes back a week
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and then relives the week, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if she doesn't talk to Okarin this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume that you would recall that we spoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but the event{omgphysics} of having spoken would be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Mayushii would remember us talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but Okarin wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd imagine so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's kind of sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You look rather unhappy, Shining Finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Did you get rid of the time machine?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, we might be able to do a time leap—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell her about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But Moeka's a lab mem, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"What's a time leap?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what it sounds like!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send memories through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be faster to head for Akibaoo{shop name} first, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss told me to stay this way all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll poison children's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm careful never to walk around with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Nae said she wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,talk to Okabe Rintaro, so we were looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad was really mean back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all this way to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What a well-trained little pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I cause trouble for Mr. Braun all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not like the Okabe Rintaro I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin's always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's gonna get going, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Meeting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give the cosplayer, Fubuki, her outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it's almost time for ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.70,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Suzu and Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's head back ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need to find the parts Christina asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu works with SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A SERN spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nullpo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...Gah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just sneak up on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's against the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you were posting on @channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I had already realized you were a channer a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wasn't, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in hiding it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I officially give you the title of channer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me any more weird nicknames!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.89,0:11:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And please, keep this a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You could list it on your résumé.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If they knew a serious academic was posting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,they'd probably make a few threads about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what? You'd sage them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate myself for understanding that last sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,someone who's so terrible at hiding things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The part-time warrior said you were a SERN spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.09,0:11:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an agent the Organization sent
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,who's had a change of heart and now works as my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's the work going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The time leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought all the parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I should make it, shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep asking myself what'll happen if we really make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I should tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like it's half-obvious already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere I can't see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a problem with my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So your father was struck by lightning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.41,0:12:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,on the grassy plains of Arkansas and fell to the dark side—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to be a jerk, I'm not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, my dad doesn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No... He hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And not as his daughter. As a scientist, as a rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad was a physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.47,0:13:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I always liked hearing him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,talk about the details of his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, by the end of elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I could understand his papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I started writing my own papers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and won awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't care about the awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved debating with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We exchanged papers by email,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and our debates got deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually, my dad stopped debating with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,While I enjoyed the debates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was also winning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I pointed out mistakes he'd made,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and without even thinking about it, I hurt his pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad started taking it out on my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and began withdrawing from his academic peers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,he said this to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"Do you pity me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you look down on me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're my daughter. How dare you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I make a device that enables a time leap,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my dad might go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more than before...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you're hesitant to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end up doing it, regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you said, I love experimenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I see a possibility, I have to investigate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like my dad used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The time I spent with my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,...was like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we begin Operation Verthandi immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization stands at our very doorstep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your response?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my destiny to change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll help you reconcile with your dad too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He's in Aomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need money to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When you work out the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean you'll go with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you in peak mental condition, so you can further my ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma, shall accompany you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and I shall use my masterful people skills
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to reunite father and daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a self-proclaimed mad scientist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when do mad scientists have people skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you're a good guy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you understand my greatness, get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so we're clear, this is now decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drag you with me, whether you want to go or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you call that Okarin guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the label!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It says "Makise" right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It reads "Makise pudding."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a brand name,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,like Morinaga pudding or Koiwai pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's "Makise," anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"Christina Makise"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you'd written "Christina" instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have accidentally ingested the extra calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat other people's food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's my spoon! Don't use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You use the lab's forks, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's cosplay materials and sleepover set!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleepover?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make some cosplay outfits for ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying over too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To work on the PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's kind of depressing to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this Hououin something guy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,who goes around eating other people's pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hououin Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn my name, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I want to hear that from!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.89,0:17:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't ignore the part about the pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but if I do, then Okabe should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab is the house of my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never leave—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is her condition for staying that I go shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been running errands for my assistant since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.00,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fry10\be5\fs50\frz13.943\move(912,710.6,912,175.8,0,2750)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.00,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fry1\be5\fs30\bord0\frz14.31\move(892.5,763.399,892.5,225.799,0,2750)}I demand compensation and an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.00,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fry1\fs45\be5\an7\frz14.47\move(672,1200,672,808.5,0,1990)}I demand two puddings, \Nas punishment for the one you ate.\NAnd... \NWe're taking a late bus to Aomori, \Ndue to finances.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"What are you so happy about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget your role as a lab mem."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get in before Okabe gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My assistant again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:00.24,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\pos(612,769.5)\frz14.75\blur1.125}You know too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:03.46,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fs149\blur7.5\b0\move(687,720,297,720,0,3195)}You\hknow\htoo\hmuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you! Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, Mayushii is very sad and very embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you peep on us in the shower, you forgot all the shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When I accessed it remotely,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought there was something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:20:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab is connected directly to the heart of SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taken over their system?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so. I win the Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I'd like to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but to be honest, I was connected before I even knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's been standing naked outside my house
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.59,0:21:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're connected, without having done anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't that imply that they've found us out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and are connecting to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... But I don't think I've made any errors that would've gotten us caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now we can use the LHC all we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can't be...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The LHC?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
